==General election==
===Campaign===
Although Brady performed considerably better than 1998 Democratic gubernatorial nominee [[Robert C. Huntley]], and won a plurality of the vote in [[Ada County, Idaho|Ada County]], the state's most populous county, Kempthorne won reelection with a comfortable majority.

